OL,3,AMinister backs legal right to job
OL,4,Asupport for young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut his Conservative counterpart Helen
OL,7,FWhately said the idea of legally
OL,8,Fguaranteeing support "doesn't make
OL,9,Fsense" and ministers should focus
OL,10,Finstead on reducing taxes paid by
OL,11,Femployers.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
