OL,3,ASouth Korea's top scorer in tax
OL,4,Aaccountancy exam admits cheating
OL,5,
OL,6,FStandardised national tests play an
OL,7,Foutsized role in career trajectories
OL,8,Ffor South Koreans, making their results
OL,9,F- and efforts to unduly inflate those
OL,10,Fresults - of great importance.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
