OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsrael kills Hamas commander in strike
OL,4,Aon Gaza camp, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local Hamas official confirmed
OL,7,FYounis's death. The Israeli military
OL,8,Fsaid it had targeted him and that prior
OL,9,Fto the strike "steps were taken to
OL,10,Fmitigate harm to civilians".
OL,12,FEyewitnesses in Gaza said four missiles
OL,13,Fstruck a tent in the Al-Waha camp,
OL,14,Fwhich shelters hundreds of displaced
OL,15,Fpeople in Al-Mawasi, causing a fire to
OL,16,Fbreak out.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
